*======================================================================
* px.a99 - a module for tests/test_kernel.py (group pixel): only the
* pixel-collision include, so that the test can call SPMPIX.
*======================================================================
       COPY "kernel.equ"
       COPY "macros.a99"

       AORG >C000
       DATA INIT,TICK,INIT,0
INIT   RT
TICK   RT

       COPY "spmpix.a99"
